"如后续版本启用 Helper，将同时提供 Developer ID 签名、公证以及完整的安装与卸载流程；当前版本不会安装或注册 Helper 服务。" = "If a later release enables the Helper, it will include Developer ID signing, notarization, and complete install and uninstall flows. This version does not install or register a Helper service.";
"当前版本通过 direct mode 读取核心 SMART / NVMe 数据；Helper 仅作为可选的增强权限通道，不影响当前检测功能。" = "This version reads core SMART / NVMe data through direct mode. The Helper is only an optional enhanced-privilege channel and is not required for current checks.";
"当前无需安装" = "Not required";
"本机配置默认隐藏序列号、Provisioning UDID、平台 UUID 等可识别设备的信息。开启后仅在本机界面展示，方便你自查；分享截图或日志前建议关闭。" = "This Mac view hides the serial number, Provisioning UDID, platform UUID, and other identifying device information by default. Revealing them only affects this local interface; turn it off before sharing screenshots or logs.";
