"平台 UUID" = "Platform UUID";
"SoC 是 Apple Silicon 的主芯片，CPU、GPU、内存控制器和很多协处理器都集成在这里。" = "The SoC is the main Apple Silicon chip, integrating the CPU, GPU, memory controller, and many coprocessors.";
"这里显示 CPU 物理核心组成。性能核心负责高负载计算，效率核心负责低功耗任务；逻辑核心是系统调度看到的可执行单元。" = "Shows the physical CPU core layout. Performance cores handle heavy work, efficiency cores handle low-power tasks, and logical cores are what the scheduler can dispatch.";
"这里显示 Apple 芯片集成 GPU 的核心数量。图形、Metal compute 和部分视频/图像任务会使用它。" = "Shows the core count of the GPU integrated into Apple Silicon. Graphics, Metal compute, and some video or imaging work use it.";
"Apple Silicon 使用统一内存，CPU 和 GPU 共享同一套高速内存池。" = "Apple Silicon uses unified memory shared by the CPU and GPU.";
"当前正在运行的 macOS 版本与构建号。系统版本会影响系统接口可见性。" = "The currently running macOS version and build. OS version can affect which system interfaces are visible.";
"Darwin 是 macOS 的底层内核版本，适合排查系统级行为差异。" = "Darwin is the lower-level macOS kernel version, useful when comparing system-level behavior.";
"Mac 从上次开机或重启到现在经过的时间。" = "Time elapsed since this Mac last started or restarted.";
"默认隐藏序列号、UDID、平台 UUID 等可识别设备的信息。可以在设置里手动开启显示。" = "Serial number, UDID, platform UUID, and other identifying device information are hidden by default. You can reveal them in Settings.";
"这是从 macOS 系统接口读取到的本机配置项，只用于本机展示，不会上传。" = "This configuration item is read from macOS system interfaces for local display only. It is not uploaded.";
"当前系统报告的图形处理器名称。Apple Silicon 的 GPU 集成在 SoC 内。" = "The graphics processor reported by the system. On Apple Silicon, the GPU is integrated into the SoC.";
"GPU 核心数量越多，Metal 图形和 compute 并行能力通常越强。" = "More GPU cores generally mean stronger parallel capacity for Metal graphics and compute.";
"system_profiler 当前没有报告在线显示器。" = "system_profiler did not report an online display.";
"当前连接的显示器及分辨率/刷新率。高刷新率和高分辨率会增加 GPU 显示管线负载。" = "The currently connected display and its resolution or refresh rate. Higher refresh rates and resolutions increase display pipeline load.";
"本机 Apple Silicon 主芯片型号。" = "The Apple Silicon chip model in this Mac.";
"性能核心适合高负载计算，能效核心更省电。" = "Performance cores are suited to heavy compute work; efficiency cores use less power.";
"Metal GPU 会使用这些 GPU 核心执行图形和 compute 任务。" = "Metal uses these GPU cores for graphics and compute tasks.";
"统一内存由 CPU/GPU 共享，容量会影响大型渲染、模型和素材任务。" = "Unified memory is shared by the CPU and GPU. Capacity affects large renders, models, and media workloads.";
"这些字段可以识别具体设备，默认隐藏；开启后仅在本机界面显示，不会上传。" = "These fields can identify a specific device. They are hidden by default; when enabled, they are shown only in the local interface and are not uploaded.";
"硬件序列号可以唯一识别这台 Mac，分享截图前请谨慎。隐藏时保留字段位置并用星号显示。" = "The hardware serial number can uniquely identify this Mac. Be careful before sharing screenshots. Hidden values keep their field position with asterisks.";
"设备 UDID 用于开发和配置描述文件场景，也属于敏感设备标识。隐藏时保留字段位置并用星号显示。" = "The device UDID is used for development and provisioning profiles, and is also a sensitive device identifier. Hidden values keep their field position with asterisks.";
"平台 UUID 是系统层面的设备唯一标识之一，默认隐藏。隐藏时保留字段位置并用星号显示。" = "The platform UUID is a system-level device identifier. It is hidden by default, with the field position preserved by asterisks.";
"当前 macOS 版本。不同版本可能影响系统接口可见性。" = "The current macOS version. Different versions may affect system interface visibility.";
"Darwin 内核版本，适合与第三方工具或崩溃日志对照。" = "The Darwin kernel version, useful when comparing third-party tools or crash logs.";
"系统共享名称，不等同于硬件型号。" = "The system sharing name. It is not the hardware model.";
"Apple Silicon 主芯片，CPU/GPU/统一内存控制器都在同一封装中。" = "The main Apple Silicon chip, with CPU, GPU, and unified memory controller in one package.";
"系统底层报告的 CPU/SoC 名称。" = "The CPU or SoC name reported by the lower-level system.";
"性能核心和效率核心的数量决定不同负载下的调度与功耗上限。" = "The number of performance and efficiency cores shapes scheduling and power limits under different workloads.";
"实际 CPU 核心数量，不包含线程或虚拟核心概念。Apple Silicon 通常没有超线程。" = "The actual CPU core count, excluding threads or virtual cores. Apple Silicon usually does not use Hyper-Threading.";
"系统调度器看到的可并行执行单元数量。" = "The number of parallel execution units visible to the system scheduler.";
"高性能核心，长时间高负载主要依赖它们拉高功耗。" = "High-performance cores that usually carry sustained heavy workloads.";
"低功耗核心，适合后台和轻任务，也会参与满核心负载。" = "Low-power cores for background and lighter work; they can also participate in all-core loads.";
"统一内存容量，CPU/GPU 共享，和传统独立显存架构不同。" = "Unified memory capacity shared by CPU and GPU, unlike traditional discrete VRAM designs.";
"产品线名称，例如 MacBook Pro。" = "Product line name, such as MacBook Pro.";
"苹果内部硬件型号标识，例如 Mac15,8；排查兼容性时很有用。" = "Apple's internal hardware model identifier, such as Mac15,8. Useful for compatibility checks.";
"销售/配置型号，不同地区和配置可能不同。" = "Sales or configuration model. It may vary by region and configuration.";
"底层固件版本，系统更新可能会改变它。" = "Low-level firmware version. System updates may change it.";
"启动链路相关版本，通常用于底层诊断。" = "Boot-chain related version, typically used for low-level diagnostics.";
"内置 SSD 的设备名称，来自系统存储信息。" = "The internal SSD device name from system storage information.";
"存储控制器与系统通信使用的协议。Apple Silicon 内置 SSD 常见为 Apple Fabric。" = "The protocol used by the storage controller to communicate with the system. Apple Silicon internal SSDs commonly report Apple Fabric.";
"当前系统卷所在内置存储容量和可用空间。" = "Capacity and free space for the internal storage containing the current system volume.";
"系统报告的存储健康状态；这里只做配置概览，不替代硬盘健康工具的完整 SMART 报告。" = "Storage health reported by the system. This is only a configuration overview and does not replace a full SMART report.";

