/* v2 core-layer errors, help text, and protocol-adaptive copy */
"PATH 中的 smartctl" = "smartctl from PATH";
"手动选择 smartctl" = "Manually Selected smartctl";
"未知来源" = "Unknown Source";
"默认内置 SSD" = "Default Internal SSD";
"smartctl 7.5（打包资源）" = "smartctl 7.5 (Bundled Resource)";
"SCSI 不可校正错误" = "SCSI Uncorrectable Errors";
"SMART 读取超时或输出异常" = "SMART Read Timed Out or Returned Abnormal Output";
"已终止本次只读查询。请确认硬盘与桥接器响应正常后再试。" = "The read-only query was terminated. Confirm that the disk and bridge are responding normally, then try again.";
"所选设备或外置桥接器没有返回可用的核心 SMART 健康数据。" = "The selected device or external bridge did not return usable core SMART health data.";
"smartctl JSON 中缺少形成健康结论所需的核心 SMART 字段。" = "The smartctl JSON is missing the core SMART fields required for a health conclusion.";
"smartctl 返回的内容不是 JSON。" = "smartctl returned content that is not JSON.";
"smartctl 未能返回可用的健康报告。" = "smartctl did not return a usable health report.";
"设备信息存在，但核心健康字段不足，无法形成可靠健康结论。" = "Device information is present, but the core health fields are insufficient for a reliable conclusion.";
"读取结果不足，需要重新检测后确认。" = "The read result is incomplete. Run the check again to confirm.";
"只允许使用该设备枚举结果允许的 smartctl 设备类型。" = "Only smartctl device types allowed by this enumerated device are permitted.";
"只允许执行固定只读参数矩阵：Auto 不传 -d，或仅使用 -d nvme|sat|scsi|sntasmedia|sntjmicron|sntrealtek，再执行固定的核心或扩展读取请求。" = "Only the fixed read-only argument matrix is permitted: Auto without -d, or -d nvme|sat|scsi|sntasmedia|sntjmicron|sntrealtek, followed by a fixed core or extended read request.";
"只允许读取枚举到的 whole-disk /dev/diskN 设备节点，不允许分区、rdisk 或任意路径。" = "Only enumerated whole-disk /dev/diskN device nodes may be read. Partitions, rdisk nodes, and arbitrary paths are not allowed.";
"smartctl 从控制器返回的硬盘型号。它通常是硬件/固件层面的名称，可能不同于系统设置或商品页面里的营销名称。" = "The disk model returned by the controller through smartctl. This hardware or firmware name may differ from the marketing name shown in System Settings or on a product page.";
"硬盘硬件序列号。界面默认隐藏；历史快照本机会保存完整值。导出报告前会提醒，因为报告可能包含可识别设备的信息。" = "The disk hardware serial number. It is hidden in the interface by default, while local history keeps the full value. The app warns before export because the report may identify the device.";
"硬盘或存储控制器固件版本，不是 macOS 系统版本。" = "The disk or storage-controller firmware version, not the macOS version.";
"硬盘与系统通信使用的存储协议，例如 NVMe、ATA/SATA 或 SCSI/SAS。协议只说明通信类型，不直接代表健康好坏。" = "The storage protocol used between the disk and system, such as NVMe, ATA/SATA, or SCSI/SAS. The protocol describes communication type, not health by itself.";
"NVMe 设备估算的寿命消耗百分比，通常基于厂商耐久度模型。0% 不代表完全没有写入；100% 也不等于立刻损坏，但表示已达到或超过设计耐久度参考线。" = "The NVMe device's estimated lifetime wear, usually based on the vendor endurance model. 0% does not mean no writes, and 100% does not mean immediate failure, but it indicates the design-endurance reference has been reached or exceeded.";
"SSD 仍可用于替代坏块或维持可靠性的备用空间比例。数值越高越好；低于或等于阈值时应重点关注。" = "The SSD spare capacity available for replacing bad blocks or maintaining reliability. Higher is better; pay close attention when it reaches or falls below the threshold.";
"设备定义的备用空间警戒线。比较时应看“可用备用空间”是否低于或等于这个阈值，而不是单独看阈值本身。" = "The device-defined spare-capacity warning line. Compare available spare against this threshold rather than interpreting the threshold alone.";
"NVMe 关键警告位掩码。0 通常表示没有关键警告；非 0 可能代表备用空间、温度、可靠性或只读状态等问题，需要结合其他字段判断。" = "The NVMe critical-warning bitmask. Zero usually means no critical warning; a nonzero value can indicate spare-capacity, temperature, reliability, or read-only issues and must be interpreted with other fields.";
"硬盘或控制器报告的当前温度，不是 CPU、机身外壳或环境温度。短时间升高常见于大量读写；长期高温更需要关注散热与负载。" = "The current temperature reported by the disk or controller, not the CPU, enclosure, or ambient temperature. Brief rises are common during heavy I/O; sustained heat deserves closer attention to cooling and workload.";
"NVMe Data Units Read 换算值。每个 data unit 按 512,000 bytes 计算。它是设备累计读取量，通常不等于 Finder 文件大小或某个 App 的单次读盘量。" = "Converted NVMe Data Units Read. Each data unit represents 512,000 bytes. This is cumulative device read volume and usually does not equal Finder file sizes or a single app read.";
"NVMe Data Units Written 换算值。每个 data unit 按 512,000 bytes 计算。它是 SSD 寿命评估的重要参考，但不能单独决定健康状态。" = "Converted NVMe Data Units Written. Each data unit represents 512,000 bytes. It is an important endurance reference, but cannot determine health by itself.";
"主机向 SSD 发出的读取命令累计次数。它是命令数量，不是 GB/TB；一次命令的数据量可能大小不同。" = "The cumulative number of read commands sent by the host to the SSD. This counts commands, not GB or TB, and command sizes can vary.";
"主机向 SSD 发出的写入命令累计次数。它和累计写入量相关，但不是同一个指标，也不等同于用户保存文件的次数。" = "The cumulative number of write commands sent by the host to the SSD. It relates to written volume but is a different metric and does not equal the number of files saved.";
"硬盘或存储控制器累计通电时间。该值可能不包含设备处于非工作电源状态的时间，因此不能直接等同于整台 Mac 的总使用时间。" = "Cumulative powered-on time reported by the disk or storage controller. It may exclude non-operational power states and is not the same as the Mac's total use time.";
"本 App 对 smartctl 读取结果的分层判断。核心健康字段可用时，即使附加错误日志明细无法读取，也不直接等同于硬盘故障。" = "The app's layered interpretation of smartctl output. When core health fields are usable, unavailable supplemental error-log details do not by themselves mean the disk has failed.";
"本次读取 smartctl 的来源。正式 App 优先使用包内 smartctl；手动路径只作为普通 direct fallback，不会作为 root helper 的任意执行路径。" = "The source of smartctl for this read. The formal app prefers the bundled binary; a manual path is only a normal direct fallback and is never an arbitrary root-helper execution path.";
"本次实际执行的 smartctl 路径。路径用于诊断和复核来源；App 不会执行除 smartctl 固定只读参数以外的任意命令。" = "The smartctl path actually executed. It is shown for diagnostics and provenance; the app executes no commands beyond the fixed read-only smartctl requests.";
"smartmontools / smartctl 的版本。不同版本对 NVMe、ATA/SATA、SCSI 字段和 JSON 输出的支持可能略有差异。" = "The smartmontools / smartctl version. Support for NVMe, ATA/SATA, SCSI fields, and JSON output can vary slightly by version.";
"区分硬盘健康和读取范围。本 App 会优先确保当前协议的核心 SMART 字段可用，再把附加日志失败放入诊断层。" = "Distinguishes disk health from read coverage. The app first verifies the core SMART fields for the current protocol, then treats supplemental-log failures as diagnostics.";
"诊断中展示的只读命令。代码层只允许固定 smartctl 参数读取枚举到的 whole-disk /dev/diskN，不允许 shell、格式化、修复、挂载或写盘类命令。" = "The read-only command shown in diagnostics. The code only permits fixed smartctl arguments against enumerated whole-disk /dev/diskN nodes, never shell, format, repair, mount, or disk-write commands.";
"当前内部 v2 已通过 direct mode 读取核心 SMART 数据。正式 Helper 属于可选增强权限通道，将在 Developer ID 签名、公证与安装/卸载流程完成后开放。" = "The internal v2 currently reads core SMART data through direct mode. The formal Helper is an optional enhanced-privilege channel to be enabled after Developer ID signing, notarization, and install/uninstall flows are complete.";
"导出的历史记录可能包含完整硬盘序列号、硬盘型号、固件版本、SMART 原始数据等设备信息。请谨慎保存和分享。" = "Exported history may contain the full disk serial number, model, firmware, and raw SMART data. Store and share it carefully.";
