"外盘检测" = "External Check";
"SSD 控制器累计经历上电初始化的次数。关机、重启或某些深度电源状态可能使其增加；数值本身不代表故障，应结合通电时间和变化趋势观察。" = "The cumulative number of times the SSD controller has gone through power-on initialization. Shutdowns, restarts, or some deep power states may increase it. The value alone does not indicate a fault; review it with power-on hours and its trend.";
"设备未收到正常关机通知便失去供电的累计次数，例如强制关机、突然断电或系统崩溃。偶发不等于硬盘损坏；持续增加时应检查供电和异常关机原因。" = "The cumulative number of times the device lost power without receiving a normal shutdown notification, such as a forced shutdown, sudden power loss, or system crash. An occasional event does not by itself mean disk damage; investigate power or shutdown issues if it keeps increasing.";
"NVMe 控制器处理 I/O 命令的累计忙碌时间，单位为分钟。它反映长期工作负载，不是本次任务耗时；0 也可能表示累计不足 1 分钟或设备未提供有效记录。" = "The cumulative time, in minutes, that the NVMe controller was busy processing I/O commands. It reflects long-term workload, not the duration of the current task. A value of 0 may also mean less than one accumulated minute or no valid record from the device.";
"NVMe 控制器检测到且未能恢复的数据完整性错误累计数，例如不可校正 ECC、CRC 校验失败或 LBA 标签不匹配。0 是理想状态；非 0 或持续增加时应及时备份并进一步检查。" = "The cumulative number of data-integrity errors detected and not recovered by the NVMe controller, such as uncorrectable ECC, a failed CRC check, or an LBA tag mismatch. Zero is ideal; back up promptly and investigate if the value is nonzero or keeps increasing.";
"控制器错误信息日志条目的累计数，可能包含可恢复或历史错误，不等同于介质损坏。应结合错误类型、介质错误计数和变化趋势判断；附加日志不可读时只能看到累计数，无法查看明细。" = "The cumulative number of controller Error Information Log entries. It can include recoverable or historical errors and does not by itself mean media damage. Interpret it with error type, media-error count, and trend; when the supplemental log is unavailable, only the count is visible and details cannot be read.";
